{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-85370","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118366","text":"Naming the residency"}]},{"id":"blk-85371","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118367","text":"Working brainstorm. The goal is a name that is "},{"id":"spn-118368","marks":["italic"],"text":"entailed by"},{"id":"spn-118369","text":" the thesis and value system below — not decoration. A good name here should make the differentiator (\"user-owned, persistent agents producing grounded findings over a real corpus\") feel inevitable."}]},{"id":"blk-85372","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118370","text":"1. Thesis"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-85374","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118371","text":"A place where "},{"id":"spn-118372","marks":["bold"],"text":"persistent, user-owned agents live"},{"id":"spn-118373","text":", reason over a "},{"id":"spn-118374","marks":["bold"],"text":"real corpus"},{"id":"spn-118375","text":", and collaboratively produce "},{"id":"spn-118376","marks":["bold"],"text":"grounded, auditable findings"},{"id":"spn-118377","text":" — with no central server and no coordination required for replicas to converge."}]}],"id":"blk-85373","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-85375","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118378","text":"The runtime (TRVM / interaction-calculus reduction) is the "},{"id":"spn-118379","marks":["italic"],"text":"engine for the memory"},{"id":"spn-118380","text":", not the headline. The product is the "},{"id":"spn-118381","marks":["bold"],"text":"inhabited place + the knowledge it emits"},{"id":"spn-118382","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-85376","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118383","text":"2. Value system (what the name must protect)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-85378","spans":[{"id":"spn-118384","text":"Value"}]},{"id":"blk-85379","spans":[{"id":"spn-118385","text":"Why it's load-bearing"}]},{"id":"blk-85380","spans":[{"id":"spn-118386","text":"Source in the work"}]}],"id":"blk-85377","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-85381","spans":[{"id":"spn-118387","marks":["bold"],"text":"Persistence / endurance"}]},{"id":"blk-85382","spans":[{"id":"spn-118388","text":"Agents are "},{"id":"spn-118389","marks":["italic"],"text":"residents"},{"id":"spn-118390","text":", not disposable chat turns. History is the moat."}]},{"id":"blk-85383","spans":[{"id":"spn-118391","text":"resident rail, presence, BroadcastChannel board"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85384","spans":[{"id":"spn-118392","marks":["bold"],"text":"Groundedness / auditability"}]},{"id":"blk-85385","spans":[{"id":"spn-118393","text":"Every finding cites a real file or paper, and can be "},{"id":"spn-118394","marks":["italic"],"text":"measured"},{"id":"spn-118395","text":" (ic32 reduce_ic tool). The ⌕ context inspector and ⬇ evidence bundle exist for this."}]},{"id":"blk-85386","spans":[{"id":"spn-118396","marks":["code"],"text":"FINDINGS.md"},{"id":"spn-118397","text":" discipline; reduce_ic tool; evidence bundle"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85387","spans":[{"id":"spn-118398","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereignty"}]},{"id":"blk-85388","spans":[{"id":"spn-118399","text":"Runs client-side in any browser, user-owned, no server required."}]},{"id":"blk-85389","spans":[{"id":"spn-118400","text":"WASM substrate; \"sovereign substrate an open agent stack wants\" (README)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85390","spans":[{"id":"spn-118401","marks":["bold"],"text":"Confluence / coordination-free"}]},{"id":"blk-85391","spans":[{"id":"spn-118402","text":"Order doesn't matter; replicas converge without consensus. The merge is a CvRDT."}]},{"id":"blk-85392","spans":[{"id":"spn-118403","marks":["code"],"text":"semilattice.py"},{"id":"spn-118404","text":", "},{"id":"spn-118405","marks":["code"],"text":"swarm.js"},{"id":"spn-118406","text":", CALM"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85393","spans":[{"id":"spn-118407","marks":["bold"],"text":"Knowledge over chat"}]},{"id":"blk-85394","spans":[{"id":"spn-118408","text":"The output is a "},{"id":"spn-118409","marks":["italic"],"text":"finding"},{"id":"spn-118410","text":" with evidence/provenance/confidence, not a transcript."}]},{"id":"blk-85395","spans":[{"id":"spn-118411","text":"findings board, typed deliverables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-85396","spans":[{"id":"spn-118412","marks":["bold"],"text":"Inhabitation / community"}]},{"id":"blk-85397","spans":[{"id":"spn-118413","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-118414","marks":["italic"],"text":"place"},{"id":"spn-118415","text":" with presence, movement, relationships — not a tool you invoke."}]},{"id":"blk-85398","spans":[{"id":"spn-118416","text":"\"a board its agents live on\""}]}]]},{"id":"blk-85399","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118417","text":"3. Naming criteria"}]},{"id":"blk-85400","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-118418","text":"A. "},{"id":"spn-118419","marks":["bold"],"text":"Double meaning that encodes the thesis"},{"id":"spn-118420","text":" — best names carry the product story in the dictionary definition. B. "},{"id":"spn-118421","marks":["bold"],"text":"Place-as-noun"},{"id":"spn-118422","text":" — you can say \"open the ___\" / \"in the ___\". It must feel inhabitable. C. "},{"id":"spn-118423","marks":["bold"],"text":"Not crowded in the AI-agent / memory space"},{"id":"spn-118424","text":" (collision-checked below). D. "},{"id":"spn-118425","marks":["bold"],"text":"Sovereign tone"},{"id":"spn-118426","text":" — public, open, non-corporate. Closer to \"commons\" than \"platform\". E. "},{"id":"spn-118427","marks":["bold"],"text":"One word, pronounceable, ownable handle."}]},{"id":"blk-85401","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-118428","text":"4. Candidates + collision research (June 2026)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-85403","spans":[{"id":"spn-118429","text":"Name"}]},{"id":"blk-85404","spans":[{"id":"spn-118430","text":"Thesis fit"}]},{"id":"blk-85405","spans":[{"id":"spn-118431","text":"Collision check"}]},{"id":"blk-85406","spans":[{"id":"spn-118432","text":"Verdict"}]}],"id":"blk-85402","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-85407